              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Sab 105:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kotema Yakob Simeon ka Lebi atiar, “Kisiyalononoto eoŋ, aituwur eoŋ kotoma kaluiboienenete kakwap, kotoma oKanaanin, ka oPerisin: ido eoŋ, naarai ikidioko ikaruna, etukonokinos rwaru aitusurup eoŋ, ka aitoji eoŋ, kamudiario, eoŋ ka ekakal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kotemasi atiar, “Kejokuna kereka ŋes aikonakin kinacikos bala nadote?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.34.31"
            ]
          }
        }
